      "$value": "ui-sans-serif",
      "$type": "fontFamily",
      "$description": "Use the native system sans throughout. Headlines use 600 weight with increasingly negative tracking as they grow: -0.2px at 40px, -1px at 60px, and -1.2px at 96px; this makes the large statements feel cut from one dense typographic plane rather than like marketing display type. Quotes remain 400 at 32px/38.4px, preserving a conversational counterweight to the compact heavy headings."
    }
